cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "BEK: a codec for 3D Gaussian Splatting scenes"
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Becchetti
    given-names: Sebastiano
repository-code: "https://github.com/sebastianobecchetti/bek"
url: "https://sebastianobecchetti.github.io/bek_online_coder/"
abstract: >-
  A C++17 codec that compresses 3D Gaussian Splatting scenes into the .bek
  container without discarding or degrading any individual splat, together with
  a parameter sweep harness and a rate-distortion analysis GUI.
license: MIT
